    "notes": "One case per compared field (#32 r3 deferred item): only `side` separates the right answer from the wrong one. Short entry 100 x 0.9998 = 99.98, exit 100 x 1.0002 = 100.02, qty 10/30: R = ((99.98 - 100.02) - (99.98 + 100.02) x 0.0005) / 30, identical to the long mirror, so a model that opened the wrong side would differ in `side` only."
